    "long": "This is accurate, dependable work in the engine room of finance. You process payments, support accounts and keep financial systems running correctly.\\nTypical roles include financial services administrator, banking operations officer and payments processor. You would work for banks, building societies and finance firms.\\nIt suits precise, reliable, numerate people. You can start from Level 3 through a financial services apprenticeship, with no degree needed."
