    "long": "This is fast, practical, active work that keeps the economy moving. You store, pick, pack and move goods, and can move up to supervising operations.\\nTypical roles include warehouse operative, logistics coordinator and team leader. You would work in warehouses, distribution centres and delivery firms.\\nIt suits energetic, reliable, organised people. You can start from Level 2 with no degree, through a supply chain or warehouse apprenticeship, and progress into management."
